@startuml
[*] --> AlertConfigurationDisabled

AlertConfigurationDisabled --> AlertConfigurationEnabled : enable feature
AlertConfigurationEnabled --> MonitoringThresholds : start monitoring
MonitoringThresholds --> AlertTriggered : threshold met
AlertTriggered --> AlertAcknowledged : alert acknowledged
AlertAcknowledged --> MonitoringThresholds : resume monitoring
MonitoringThresholds --> AlertConfigurationUpdated : update configuration
AlertConfigurationUpdated --> MonitoringThresholds : apply changes
MonitoringThresholds --> AlertDisabled : disable alert
AlertDisabled --> MonitoringThresholds : re-enable monitoring

AlertConfigurationEnabled --> [*] : feature disabled
@enduml
